n1. **IPv4 validation** `(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4]\\d|1\\d{2}|[1-9]?\\d)`:\n   - Matches 250-255, 200-249, 100-199, and 0-99 respectively\n   - Prevents leading zeros in octets\n\n2. **Date validation** with month-specific day ranges:\n   - Months 01,03,05,07,08,10,12 → days 01-31\n   - Months 04,06,09,11 → days 01-30\n   - Month 02 → days 01-29 (as required)\n\n3. **Last date matching**: The negative lookahead `(?!.*\\b\\d{4}...)\\b)` ensures only the last date on a line is captured\n\n4. **Word boundaries**: `\\b` prevents matching dates/IPs with adjacent alphanumerics (e.g., \"1234-12-1234\" in \"user1234-12-1234\" won't match)\n\n5. **Line filtering**: Positive lookahead verifies the line contains an IPv4 before attempting to match a date\n\nWhen used with `re.findall(pattern, log_text, re.MULTILINE)`, it returns only the last date from lines containing at least one valid IPv4 address.","ttft_ms":91404,"type":"result","duration_ms":97449,"uuid":"67e14849-b033-436f-b1a7-99a1fcfa3659","ttft_stream_ms":1000,"time_to_request_ms":57,"queued_turn_count":0}
